Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}青椒的怨恨！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.85,0:00:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇…呜哇！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胡萝卜的复仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.45,0:00:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}茄子的怨恨！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.13,0:00:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黄瓜的心愿！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈修）喂喂。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好像有什么有意思的事发生了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧，德罗瓦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）D的22区块
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华期间发生异常。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}似乎使用了某种特殊规则。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.21,0:00:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈修）喂、喂。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.03,0:00:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.47,0:00:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.99,0:00:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）啊～嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然不吃决斗饭就没力气啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.59,0:01:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马 你给我吃慢一点啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是我真的超饿的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.73,0:01:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）真是的～。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呱——！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！喂 等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等我啊～。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.43,0:01:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～我的决斗饭。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（丰作）怎么了？在这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.38,0:01:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}瘫坐着。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.67,0:01:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来 吃根黄瓜吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.07,0:01:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会打起精神来的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.25,0:01:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吃～这是什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.55,0:01:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的超好吃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的 好好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.51,0:01:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个 是你做的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特别好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 啊啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.09,0:01:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～！超好吃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.11,0:01:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是 九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.95,0:01:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.97,0:01:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天 天使的笑容……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.89,0:02:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.30,0:02:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 我是 矢最丰收！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.43,0:02:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在蔬菜当中尤其喜欢番茄！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.63,0:02:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄的乐园 番茄·天堂{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.49,0:02:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是能在这条街上建成你不觉得会很有趣吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番 番茄·天堂！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（丰收）正是！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.29,0:02:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄的、由番茄打造{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.91,0:02:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为番茄而设的主题乐园！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.93,0:02:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要是在决斗嘉年华上夺冠的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这座城市建一座番茄乐园！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到　到时候就像番茄一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给笑容如此美好的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那　那个～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.73,0:02:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄乐园的形象女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.29,0:02:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能拜托你来当吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.10,0:02:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来当番茄的形象女孩！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）所谓形象女孩就是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～我是番茄酱哦～
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.41,0:02:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁要让你当啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.71,0:02:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:02:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能让你干这种事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.09,0:02:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.81,0:03:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.54,0:03:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}丰收　你送蔬菜的恩情我不会忘。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.35,0:03:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是　你和我所走的道路似乎不一样啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马　你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一决胜负吧，丰作！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦，有意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.79,0:03:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要在这届大会上夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.85,0:03:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后打造番茄天堂{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让小鸟小姐来当形象代言人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的野心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.73,0:03:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就由我来亲手粉碎给你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！一飞冲天，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说游马。在这里咱们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来搞个原创规则怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原创规则？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.48,0:05:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（丰作）玩家在攻击之前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要从那个蔬菜篮里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.29,0:05:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拿出一个蔬菜。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.93,0:05:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.31,0:05:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有的攻击都要先吃掉那个蔬菜。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就命名为 蔬菜死斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.71,0:05:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种规则居然擅自定出来怎么可能接受……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.76,0:05:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们倒是挺来劲的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思 那个规则
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华运营委员{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈修认可了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.51,0:05:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 蔬菜混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.27,0:05:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}街上发生的骚动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.38,0:05:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 是你干的好事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.07,0:05:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈修！你又擅自乱来……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈修）有什么不好嘛 德罗瓦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是图个气氛 气氛。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蔬菜死斗 不是挺有意思的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵 是吧 是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 喜欢蔬菜的丰作就{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}占绝对优势了不是吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了 少年？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.44,0:06:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说你讨厌蔬菜？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.65,0:06:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挑食可不好。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才 才没那回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我哪有什么挑食！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 一三零零
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蔬菜死斗规则 许可！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 加油吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说了等一下啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.31,0:06:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 鲜红的番茄是先攻的证明！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.35,0:06:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}发动{\fnYusei Magic} {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}场{\fnYusei Magic}地魔法番茄・天堂！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在召唤植物族怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.29,0:06:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤一只番茄衍生物。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.73,0:06:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄天堂！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.84,0:06:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都变成番茄了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 番茄士兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄士兵是植物族
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此特殊召唤番茄衍生物！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄怪兽！？ 从头到尾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全给我统一成番茄了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}furthermore 永续魔法 番茄弹射器发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过解放植物族怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予400点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招！ 番茄的红雨！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.75,0:07:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈… 熟透通红的番茄味道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是最棒的吧 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！ 番茄番茄的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.03,0:07:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看我把你这种卡组碾碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 阿查查弓手！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿查查弓手 在召唤时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.23,0:08:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！阿恰恰弓箭手！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，再用阿恰恰弓箭手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.98,0:08:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击番茄步兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.34,0:08:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，要攻击的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.55,0:08:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得从这里拿一个蔬菜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃掉才能攻击啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.43,0:08:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这手感滑溜溜的，又软软的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是……茄子！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.57,0:08:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊，这是～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.60,0:08:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是我改良品种的小茄子番茄。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还能做腌菜的全能番茄！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶～。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.96,0:08:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，为什么没攻击？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.26,0:09:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还在警戒敌人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.61,0:09:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗和蔬菜都讲究时机！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.98,0:09:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 可别后悔刚才没有攻击啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.35,0:09:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！ 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 番茄套娃！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡召唤成功时可以从卡组 或者手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.61,0:09:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤 番茄套娃。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.48,0:09:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄套娃是植物族
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.47,0:09:25.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 通过番茄乐园的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.19,0:09:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤2只番茄衍生物！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.91,0:09:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}5只番茄怪兽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.27,0:09:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 番茄乐园！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上 速攻魔法！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.98,0:09:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 番茄矩阵！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 直到结束阶段{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让植物族怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.89,0:09:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:48.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过番茄魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄大家族 更加强大了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.12,0:09:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 根据蔬菜死斗规则{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.48,0:09:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从篮子里抽卡，抽蔬菜！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}青椒啊……真好吃～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，要来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.41,0:10:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用番茄骑兵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击阿恰恰弓手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.95,0:10:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄强袭！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.47,0:10:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（番茄骑兵）番～茄～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（阿恰恰弓手）阿恰～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.51,0:10:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃啊……！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.70,0:10:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再用番茄套娃直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！番茄小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样！剩下3只
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击的话，就是我赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.67,0:10:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的……振作点啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！是陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……我发动陷阱卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.41,0:10:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动痛恨的控诉！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯……！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.81,0:10:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因直接攻击而受到伤害时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得对方守备力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.55,0:10:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最高的怪兽的控制权{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到下一个对方回合为止！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备力最高的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.89,0:10:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄套娃。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:53.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就收下还没攻击过的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:11:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只番茄套娃了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.14,0:11:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦…这样一来，老夫的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就被封住了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是…永续魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄弹射器的效果还在！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放2只番茄衍生物{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成800点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧！番茄的红雨！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.67,0:11:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，老夫就回合结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜呜…全是番茄…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！我的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把番茄套娃解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升级召唤咔嚓咔嚓弓箭手！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（咔嚓咔嚓弓箭手）咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔嚓咔嚓弓箭手一回合一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.75,0:11:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.82,0:11:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法陷阱卡一张！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:48.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.21,0:11:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动咔嚓咔嚓弓箭手的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.32,0:11:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏弹射番茄！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.87,0:11:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.12,0:12:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动破天荒的风！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让自己场上的一只怪兽攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升１０００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.13,0:12:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就行了。游马，攻击吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻……攻击！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要攻击的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡抽到蔬菜… 唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这手感… 细长的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.63,0:12:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黄瓜！ 啊…？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马黄瓜也有红色的品种吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？ 又是番茄～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.38,0:12:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙也是经过品种改良的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黄瓜型番茄 小瓜。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.27,0:12:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爽脆的口感最适合做沙拉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.97,0:12:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太… 太卑鄙了 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪里卑鄙了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.85,0:12:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只不过是在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尝试番茄的无限可能性而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 你这混蛋！ 番茄 番茄的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞得像是什么恶作剧似的～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.61,0:12:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这玩意…把番茄…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！你怎么了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.68,0:13:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不吃蔬菜的话就没法攻击啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然还是不行啊～。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.74,0:13:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你该不会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.53,0:13:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.39,0:13:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，最讨厌番茄了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体／小鸟）哎…？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.51,0:13:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}讨厌番茄什么的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.68,0:13:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，我就是不擅长吃番茄！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本吃不下去啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你居然因为这种事拼上性命去决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那…那么，你是为了我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是在为我而战吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.50,0:13:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.35,0:13:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算……算了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟～？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次决斗饭里给你放番茄……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总……总之我盖一张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.28,0:13:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:14:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（丰收）你这家伙……讨厌番茄吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.02,0:14:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道吃不了我的番茄吗～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.90,0:14:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.42,0:14:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}讨厌蔬菜的家伙我绝对不会原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要为了消灭像你这种讨厌蔬菜的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打造番茄天堂！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.01,0:14:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…吵死了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.37,0:14:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么番茄乐园别擅自建啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 为了我的梦想无论如何都要实现{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.61,0:14:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对 要赢～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.15,0:14:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 番茄套娃！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.51,0:14:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再 特殊召唤番茄衍生物！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.89,0:14:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级3的怪兽有3只。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级3的 番茄套娃2只和
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄步兵进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.70,0:14:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大地的恩惠 太阳的赠礼！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.74,0:15:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄王  dread king！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好……好可爱。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于番茄乐园的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤番茄衍生物！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.54,0:15:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 我还要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.73,0:15:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动番茄王  dreadking的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.59,0:15:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.53,0:15:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用叠放单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.63,0:15:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到自己回合的准备阶段{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡的原本攻击力变成两倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎哎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.54,0:15:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次是番茄怪物吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.07,0:15:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且攻击力3200！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就结束了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.45,0:15:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}dreadking！攻击番茄番茄弓箭手！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.65,0:15:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄红素飞溅！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.87,0:15:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.57,0:15:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.44,0:15:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！我赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.86,0:15:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.33,0:15:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么生命值还有剩？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动了陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}交易召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.55,0:16:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己怪兽被攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌中有攻击力1000以下的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽时可以发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让战斗伤害下降500点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将攻击力1000以下的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.03,0:16:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.72,0:16:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！我我我少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.43,0:16:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为代价因交易召唤的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽在对方回合
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算起2个回合内{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.15,0:16:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被战斗破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.85,0:16:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈…嘛，无所谓了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你剩下的生命值只有400了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.05,0:16:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}讨厌番茄的家伙怎么可能赢得了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.75,0:16:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，把 我我我魔术师 的等级改变吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！ 我把我我我魔术师 的等级变更为3！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，接下来就看你的了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:16:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:17:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要在这里进行超量召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.97,0:17:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜利的方程式就完成了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，为此你必须得吃蔬菜才行…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是… 是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要想攻击，就只能吃蔬菜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.27,0:17:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次一定要抽到番茄以外的东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.30,0:17:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是… 这手感是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对 不是番茄！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是胡萝卜～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（丰收）哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙也是我做的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.89,0:17:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胡萝卜型番茄 番茄萝酱！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.30,0:17:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎哎～！可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂～ 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至少给我吃点番茄啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.03,0:17:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 游马再这样下去 你会输的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.73,0:17:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！不管你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄什么的我都吃不下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.27,0:17:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样好吗？游马要是输了丰作君夺冠的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.81,0:17:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座城市就会变成番茄天堂哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.51,0:17:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到那时候 我就会 每天去游马家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:18:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄沙拉配番茄披萨！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.91,0:18:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把加了番茄的决斗饭全套餐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}硬塞给你吃哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什～么～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是不想那样的话 现在就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我克服掉讨厌番茄的毛病！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢他就只能克服你不擅长的东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来 吃吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.77,0:18:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜～
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烦死了 我知道了啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃就行了吧 吃就行了吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天 我～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.59,0:18:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.01,0:18:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超——好吃呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.79,0:18:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.59,0:18:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这玩意儿我以前从来没吃过啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.69,0:18:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗 游马～
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.86,0:18:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你吃了啊～。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.22,0:18:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于 你吃了啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.07,0:18:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就能赢他了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.43,0:18:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.98,0:18:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把变成等级3的嘎嘎嘎魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.71,0:19:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎女孩进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.85,0:19:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.09,0:19:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.21,0:19:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，我的新伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}管魔人 迷迷迷旋律～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（迷迷迷旋律）呜呼。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后嘎嘎嘎女孩{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.17,0:19:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与名字带有嘎嘎嘎的怪兽一起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.79,0:19:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为超量素材的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将对方1只超量怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.24,0:19:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成零！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.75,0:19:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}零零呼唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（嘎嘎嘎女孩）哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（恐惧大王）哆咧～。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.02,0:19:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的恐惧大王啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！管魔人 迷迷迷旋律！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄王 攻击恐龙王！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.93,0:19:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}美乐林波浪！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.81,0:19:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此时 由于交易召唤的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.26,0:19:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄王 恐龙王不会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 伤害你还是得吃下！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.65,0:19:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.06,0:19:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.93,0:20:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且管魔人 美乐美乐旋律的超量效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.79,0:20:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 管魔人 美乐美乐旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.56,0:20:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.51,0:20:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击后 对方场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.97,0:20:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有怪兽超量的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.71,0:20:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以再攻击一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.59,0:20:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}丰收 你的番茄 最棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用管魔人 美乐美乐旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击番茄王 恐龙王！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.59,0:20:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哆咧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.21,0:20:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再一次 管魔人 美乐美乐旋律的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.13,0:20:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动超量效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 魅惑旋律！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魅惑音波！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.67,0:20:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔噢～ 番茄啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.03,0:20:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的心就像番茄一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.03,0:20:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧得通红通红的～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.48,0:20:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 没事吧 丰收！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.39,0:21:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.37,0:21:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.07,0:21:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.97,0:21:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.26,0:21:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 多亏了你 总算明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.01,0:21:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}番茄这玩意 真是好吃到爆啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗虽然是我赢了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.89,0:21:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但对番茄的 那份热情还是你更胜一筹。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.59,0:21:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗虽然是我输了 但你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.21,0:21:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能喜欢上番茄{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正合我意～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.99,0:21:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，能看到一个男人克服讨厌番茄的瞬间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一幕现在感动得不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.05,0:21:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大丰收…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.28,0:21:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马～！番茄之友～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.42,0:21:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.01,0:21:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么就这样吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.37,0:21:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.89,0:21:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙虽然有点怪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.91,0:21:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是个好人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.48,0:21:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.61,0:22:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}观察结果16。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.30,0:22:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天好像对讨厌番茄也有效啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.34,0:22:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！就照这个势头一路冲到冠军去～！

